WEBVTT

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:11.730
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:17.240
<i>tsukanoma no yasuragi mo furikitte</i>
Shaking off the desire to rest

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:23.410
<i>hitasura massugu ni hashiri tsuzuketa</i>
I resume my forward journey

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:26.540
<i>nagareru ase nuguwazuni</i>
Without wiping the sweat off my brow

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:34.590
<i>butsukarukotode fukaku musubitsuku yuujou</i>
The friendship that grows through fighting

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:40.680
<i>kizutsuitakoto wa mudaja nakattane</i>
Getting hurt was never a waste

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:45.600
<i>kanashimi ni kureta toki</i>
When you're wallowing in sorrow

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:49.730
<i>sotto te o sashinobete miyou</i>
Let's reach out with your hand

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:52.940
<i>kitto itsumademo tomo wa</i>
I'm sure friends will be there

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:57.200
<i>kimi o mimamotte iru</i>
Watching over you

00:00:57.360 --> 00:01:00.620
<i>hitorija naikara</i>
Since we are not alone

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:04.620
<i>chikaiaou kitto</i>
Let's swear to each other

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:09.380
<i>itsuka jidai ga kawattemo</i>
That even when times change

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:12.380
<i>boku wa wasurenai</i>
I will never forget you

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:16.630
I trust you forever

00:01:24.720 --> 00:01:26.230
Domon...

00:01:26.230 --> 00:01:27.600
Listen.

00:01:27.810 --> 00:01:30.770
This is our only chance to
defeat the Devil Gundam!

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:33.150
Attack now...

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:37.200
...so we don't repeat the tragedy
Kyoji and I had to experience!

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:37.860
Attack!

00:01:38.610 --> 00:01:40.870
Do it!

00:01:44.790 --> 00:01:48.500
Kyoji!

00:01:52.380 --> 00:01:53.500
What's that?

00:02:12.360 --> 00:02:13.900
This can't be happening!

00:02:18.810 --> 00:02:19.780
K-Kyoji...

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:25.330
Kyoji!

00:02:28.950 --> 00:02:30.330
Everyone...

00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:33.000
The Devil Gundam has
finally been defeated.

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:35.600
However, to accomplish this...

00:02:35.600 --> 00:02:37.790
...Domon Kasshu was forced
to sacrifice the lives...

00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:40.840
...of his brother Kyoji,
and Schwarz Bruder.

00:02:40.840 --> 00:02:43.430
This must've been
devastating to Domon.

00:02:44.680 --> 00:02:48.640
But despite this grief and sorrow,
the Gundam Fight continues.

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:49.810
Yes.

00:02:49.810 --> 00:02:51.890
It will now be the ultimate battle...

00:02:51.890 --> 00:02:55.360
...between the Undefeated of
the East and Domon Kasshu.

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:56.480
And now!

00:02:57.440 --> 00:02:59.780
Gundam Fight Final Match!

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:02.450
Ready! Go!

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:08.490
Farewell, Master!
Master Asia's Last Breath

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:16.500
My...

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:18.420
My Devil Gundam...

00:03:22.300 --> 00:03:24.220
I'll never forgive you.

00:03:24.260 --> 00:03:25.970
I'll never forgive you!

00:03:25.970 --> 00:03:27.390
Domon!

00:03:30.180 --> 00:03:33.270
Do you understand what
you've just done?!

00:03:33.270 --> 00:03:35.400
Shut up, Master Asia!

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:36.110
What?!

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:38.280
Using the Devil Gundam...

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:41.360
You're an evil villain who
plotted to take over the world!

00:03:41.530 --> 00:03:42.740
Don't be stupid!

00:03:42.740 --> 00:03:45.880
When did I ever say I wanted
to take over the world?!

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:47.500
I know your plans with Wong!

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:49.160
Think you can talk
your way out of it?!

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:52.290
I only took advantage of him!

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:55.220
I was hoping Wong could help me...

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:56.210
...resurrect the Devil Gundam!

00:03:56.210 --> 00:03:59.000
Then why do you need
the Devil Gundam?!

00:04:00.710 --> 00:04:02.590
Do you want to know?

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:05.590
Then I'll explain it to you
in the form of a battle!

00:04:05.590 --> 00:04:07.650
I'd like nothing better!

00:04:07.650 --> 00:04:09.510
Gundam Fight!

00:04:09.510 --> 00:04:11.310
Ready!

00:04:11.540 --> 00:04:12.810
Go!

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:22.490
B-Bro...

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:29.410
Bro's still fighting!

00:04:29.410 --> 00:04:31.740
What?! We've got
to go help him!

00:04:31.740 --> 00:04:32.620
Stay back.

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:34.750
This battle...

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:39.090
...will probably go down in
history as the greatest fight ever.

00:04:39.290 --> 00:04:40.210
Observe.

00:04:48.090 --> 00:04:49.180
Look...

00:04:49.180 --> 00:04:52.390
A former master and pupil
are fighting it out...

00:04:52.390 --> 00:04:54.230
...with everything they've got.

00:04:57.230 --> 00:04:58.810
This is no longer...

00:04:58.810 --> 00:05:01.320
...a world that we can enter.

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:07.280
Undefeated of the
East, Master Asia!

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:08.610
Prepare yourself!

00:05:08.610 --> 00:05:10.070
Don't be smug!

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:11.240
Secret technique!

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:12.950
King's Pawn...

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:15.000
...in the Twelve
Ohobai Daishahei!

00:05:20.170 --> 00:05:20.750
Kizan!

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:22.630
Shokojin!

00:05:25.010 --> 00:05:26.050
How's that?!

00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:29.470
Still have trouble figuring
this out after being pummeled?!

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:31.220
You dimwitted pupil!

00:05:31.220 --> 00:05:32.720
Wh-why you!

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:34.430
You saw it yourself.

00:05:34.430 --> 00:05:36.810
The hidden side
of Neo Hong Kong.

00:05:38.350 --> 00:05:39.650
That's right.

00:05:39.650 --> 00:05:43.190
While the world is going
crazy over the Gundam Fight...

00:05:43.190 --> 00:05:46.780
...more places around the world
are becoming just like that!

00:05:47.320 --> 00:05:48.400
Whether it be Rome...

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:50.740
...Paris or London...

00:05:50.740 --> 00:05:53.450
...or even your own
Kyoto of Neo Japan.

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:56.870
Don't you see these cities
are headed for destruction?!

00:05:56.870 --> 00:05:58.000
Now, Domon.

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:01.630
From all this, haven't
you learned anything...

00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:03.830
...of Earth's last moments?

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:06.170
Then...

00:06:06.170 --> 00:06:10.220
...you'll probably never know
who's responsible for all this.

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:12.850
You know...

00:06:12.850 --> 00:06:14.890
...when I realized this myself...

00:06:14.890 --> 00:06:19.060
...I could not stand and watch
the Earth remain in this state.

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:19.940
Therefore...

00:06:19.940 --> 00:06:21.560
...I made a solemn oath.

00:06:22.060 --> 00:06:23.940
No matter what happens...

00:06:23.940 --> 00:06:29.030
...I will do what it takes to restore
Earth back to its natural state.

00:06:29.320 --> 00:06:31.610
Wh-what do you mean?

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:38.960
But why tell us now?

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:42.960
This all may be unexpected,
but I can still pull it off.

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:45.500
Master! Master East!

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:46.920
Well...

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:49.700
Your intention to revive
Earth is truly commendable.

00:06:49.700 --> 00:06:51.550
You evil snake!

00:06:51.550 --> 00:06:53.140
What do you want now?!

00:06:53.140 --> 00:06:54.930
What's up your sleeve?!

00:06:54.930 --> 00:06:57.560
And that's rather harsh.

00:06:57.560 --> 00:06:59.770
Well, you're absolutely right.

00:07:00.060 --> 00:07:00.950
However...

00:07:01.010 --> 00:07:04.730
...please understand that
my wishes to have you...

00:07:04.730 --> 00:07:06.610
...win the Gundam
Fight are sincere.

00:07:06.900 --> 00:07:08.050
You see...

00:07:08.050 --> 00:07:10.530
...I want Neo Hong Kong
to win the right...

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:12.570
...to rule the universe
for four more years!

00:07:12.900 --> 00:07:17.920
And if we can revive the Devil
Gundam into a benign Gundam...

00:07:17.920 --> 00:07:19.310
Don't make me laugh!

00:07:19.310 --> 00:07:23.450
I don't think you understand
the word "benign"!

00:07:23.450 --> 00:07:24.670
You sneaky politician!

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:27.120
Listen well.

00:07:27.120 --> 00:07:28.890
My goal here...

00:07:28.890 --> 00:07:31.630
...is the annihilation
of mankind on Earth!

00:07:32.380 --> 00:07:33.630
What?!

00:07:34.260 --> 00:07:35.600
Why, you!

00:07:35.600 --> 00:07:37.720
That's what the Devil
Gundam was for?!

00:07:37.760 --> 00:07:38.560
No.

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:40.850
That is the will of
the Devil Gundam.

00:07:40.850 --> 00:07:42.120
What?!

00:07:42.120 --> 00:07:43.310
That's crazy!

00:07:43.610 --> 00:07:44.770
Domon!

00:07:44.770 --> 00:07:49.750
I'm sure you heard from Schwarz
that the Devil Gundam...

00:07:49.750 --> 00:07:51.650
...was created as a
means to revive Earth.

00:07:53.110 --> 00:07:54.190
However...

00:07:54.190 --> 00:07:57.120
...when it descended to Earth,
the impact caused a malfunction.

00:07:57.450 --> 00:08:00.880
Its three great theories to
revive Earth took a giant leap...

00:08:00.880 --> 00:08:03.040
...and it came up with another answer.

00:08:03.810 --> 00:08:06.290
To wipe out humanity.

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:08.500
What...?!

00:08:08.800 --> 00:08:10.460
Don't you understand?

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:13.470
By eliminating humans,
which ruin the Earth...

00:08:13.470 --> 00:08:15.720
...nature will restore
the Earth itself.

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:21.850
And as long as the Devil
Gundam remains on Earth...

00:08:21.850 --> 00:08:24.940
...no human will set foot
on this planet again.

00:08:29.730 --> 00:08:30.500
That's it.

00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:32.610
There's the solution!
The best solution!

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:36.610
To make it a reality,
humanity shall vanish!

00:08:38.100 --> 00:08:39.490
M-Master...

00:08:39.490 --> 00:08:42.120
H-he's crazy.

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:43.870
The man's gone nuts.

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:47.000
Wh-what is it now?!

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:49.590
What?!

00:09:00.300 --> 00:09:01.430
Allenby!

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:03.980
What are you still doing here?!

00:09:11.610 --> 00:09:13.570
Don't do it, Allenby!

00:09:15.320 --> 00:09:17.970
H-help me!

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:25.040
Allenby!

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:27.250
The Berserker System is off!

00:09:27.250 --> 00:09:29.040
Come to your senses!

00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:30.670
Allenby!

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:43.890
Allenby.

00:09:43.890 --> 00:09:46.850
This is the only way
left to save you!

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:48.480
Come!

00:09:58.130 --> 00:09:59.290
Here I go!

00:10:04.450 --> 00:10:10.000
Ultimate Bull's Eye!
Rising Arrow!

00:10:29.390 --> 00:10:33.110
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:47.200
I'm so sorry.

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:51.080
I wasn't able to save you.

00:10:51.750 --> 00:10:52.790
Forgive me.

00:10:54.670 --> 00:10:58.010
No, Rain. There's still time.

00:11:02.640 --> 00:11:06.560
The DG cells haven't taken
over this young woman yet.

00:11:10.020 --> 00:11:12.350
I'm very sorry, Rain.

00:11:12.690 --> 00:11:15.020
Involving my own
daughter in this.

00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:17.780
I'm not fit to be your father.

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:19.240
Father...

00:11:19.240 --> 00:11:23.570
I intend to tell the truth
about what we have done...

00:11:23.570 --> 00:11:27.080
...and prove that Dr.
Kasshu is innocent.

00:11:27.490 --> 00:11:28.830
Yes.

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:31.120
I will atone for everything.

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:35.080
Yes.

00:11:35.080 --> 00:11:36.540
Atonement.

00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:40.340
We must atone for the
crimes we've committed.

00:11:40.340 --> 00:11:41.840
With my own hands.

00:11:42.010 --> 00:11:42.800
Yes.

00:11:43.220 --> 00:11:44.800
The great land floating in space.

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:48.850
The forests, mountains
and the lakes.

00:11:49.170 --> 00:11:53.120
I'll take this Earth back
from these pathetic humans...

00:11:53.120 --> 00:11:57.070
...who don't realize they're
living in an artificial world.

00:11:57.070 --> 00:12:00.530
That doesn't give you the
right to wipe out humanity!

00:12:00.780 --> 00:12:02.280
You still don't get it?!

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:06.370
Why's the Gundam
Fight important?!

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:09.620
Why call it an ideal war?!

00:12:13.670 --> 00:12:17.130
What is there to gain from victory?

00:12:17.130 --> 00:12:19.250
It's all just a game.

00:12:20.090 --> 00:12:21.210
However...

00:12:21.210 --> 00:12:23.880
...it's better than the
indiscriminate loss of life!

00:12:23.880 --> 00:12:26.930
That's why you're such a fool!

00:12:28.600 --> 00:12:30.180
Darkness...

00:12:30.180 --> 00:12:31.680
...God...

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:34.270
...Finger!

00:12:40.620 --> 00:12:42.150
Wh-what's this?

00:12:42.570 --> 00:12:44.900
I feel deep sorrow
from his fists.

00:12:45.530 --> 00:12:47.280
Undefeated of the East...

00:12:47.280 --> 00:12:48.990
His fist is crying!

00:12:48.990 --> 00:12:50.330
Wh-why is it?!

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:51.700
Silence!

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:55.920
His sadness beats in my heart.

00:12:56.270 --> 00:12:57.380
That's right.

00:12:57.380 --> 00:13:00.630
You taught me that one's
fist reflects one's soul.

00:13:01.090 --> 00:13:03.130
It's this man who taught me that.

00:13:04.040 --> 00:13:08.220
Then, is this his soul crying out?!

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:15.180
If only this body of
mine were healthy...

00:13:15.180 --> 00:13:17.480
...there wouldn't
have been a problem.

00:13:17.480 --> 00:13:20.980
I myself could have become
a part of the Devil Gundam.

00:13:21.720 --> 00:13:23.440
That is most regrettable!

00:13:23.440 --> 00:13:24.440
You!

00:13:25.150 --> 00:13:26.990
No more discussion!

00:13:28.410 --> 00:13:30.490
In that case...

00:13:30.910 --> 00:13:33.160
Chokyu!

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:35.160
Haoh!

00:13:36.290 --> 00:13:37.900
Den!

00:13:37.900 --> 00:13:39.130
Ei!

00:13:39.130 --> 00:13:41.810
Dan!

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:56.810
Can you hear that?

00:13:56.810 --> 00:13:57.810
Yeah.

00:13:58.020 --> 00:14:00.730
The sad, beautiful sound of souls.

00:14:01.150 --> 00:14:03.940
Until my last breath, I'll
never forget this fight.

00:14:04.480 --> 00:14:06.610
It's the truest Gundam Fight!

00:14:09.240 --> 00:14:10.340
Well, Domon.

00:14:10.340 --> 00:14:13.450
Still don't understand how I feel?!

00:14:13.450 --> 00:14:14.670
Yeah!

00:14:14.670 --> 00:14:17.660
All you intend is
nothing but slaughter.

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:19.370
Domon...

00:14:24.090 --> 00:14:26.550
You big fool!

00:14:28.010 --> 00:14:29.260
Undefeated of the East!

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:31.470
You are mistaken!

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:32.680
What?

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:34.310
That's because...

00:14:34.310 --> 00:14:37.850
...the humans who you're
trying to eliminate...

00:14:37.850 --> 00:14:40.520
...were born here as part of nature.

00:14:40.520 --> 00:14:42.690
They are a part of the Earth.

00:14:43.900 --> 00:14:48.190
How can you revive the Earth
if you've forgotten that?

00:14:48.190 --> 00:14:48.860
That's right.

00:14:48.860 --> 00:14:52.530
An idealized world that
does not include humans...

00:14:52.530 --> 00:14:53.870
...is doomed to fail!

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:03.050
Then why don't we settle
this once and for all...

00:15:03.050 --> 00:15:05.090
...to determine which
one of us is right?

00:15:05.090 --> 00:15:06.300
Sure!

00:15:06.460 --> 00:15:09.260
In the name of the King of Hearts!

00:15:32.860 --> 00:15:34.200
Here I come!

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:35.490
Yeah!

00:15:39.590 --> 00:15:41.000
School of...

00:15:41.750 --> 00:15:43.750
...the Undefeated of the East!

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:46.170
Ultimate!

00:15:46.170 --> 00:15:48.630
Secret technique!

00:15:49.420 --> 00:15:50.470
There they come!

00:15:51.090 --> 00:15:51.820
Seki!

00:15:51.820 --> 00:15:52.430
Ha!

00:15:52.430 --> 00:15:56.390
Tenkyoken!

00:16:06.860 --> 00:16:08.070
Chibodee!

00:16:08.070 --> 00:16:10.780
We're not moving from here!

00:16:10.780 --> 00:16:12.700
We'll watch to the end!

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:13.990
That's because this is...

00:16:13.990 --> 00:16:17.450
...the moment we've
dreamed of this past year!

00:16:28.960 --> 00:16:30.660
Is that it?

00:16:30.660 --> 00:16:34.500
Have you already reached the
limit of your abilities?!

00:16:35.180 --> 00:16:37.550
And you call yourself
the King of Hearts?!

00:16:39.560 --> 00:16:40.970
Use your legs...

00:16:40.970 --> 00:16:42.640
...and crouch down!

00:16:43.230 --> 00:16:46.650
You can't even beat
one villain like me...

00:16:46.650 --> 00:16:48.610
...you worthless pupil!

00:16:50.570 --> 00:16:52.240
What's wrong?

00:16:52.240 --> 00:16:56.570
To kneel is to give up the fight!

00:16:58.810 --> 00:16:59.700
Rise!

00:16:59.700 --> 00:17:01.290
Show that you can rise!

00:17:01.950 --> 00:17:03.080
Shut up.

00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:06.670
Today I'll show that
I can surpass you!

00:17:14.130 --> 00:17:15.220
Go!

00:17:15.220 --> 00:17:16.340
Domon!

00:17:16.590 --> 00:17:17.720
Finish him off!

00:17:17.720 --> 00:17:19.220
Get him!

00:17:22.180 --> 00:17:25.060
Sekiha Tenkyo!

00:17:25.060 --> 00:17:28.900
God Finger!

00:17:30.820 --> 00:17:34.870
Heat End!

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:36.010
Very good...

00:17:36.740 --> 00:17:38.320
At this moment...

00:17:38.320 --> 00:17:41.530
...you have proven yourself
to be the true King of Hearts.

00:17:43.750 --> 00:17:44.840
Master...

00:17:47.770 --> 00:17:52.880
Master!

00:18:07.140 --> 00:18:08.350
Master...

00:18:09.150 --> 00:18:10.400
Master...

00:18:10.940 --> 00:18:12.480
Master Asia...

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:19.160
We have come for you.

00:18:21.410 --> 00:18:23.240
I apologize to you.

00:18:23.240 --> 00:18:27.250
We should have realized sooner.

00:18:27.580 --> 00:18:28.790
Yes.

00:18:28.790 --> 00:18:31.580
In order to verify whether
the Gundam Fight was right...

00:18:32.170 --> 00:18:35.920
...you entered the previous
Gundam Fight Tournament.

00:18:35.920 --> 00:18:37.840
And you fought,
and you fought...

00:18:38.300 --> 00:18:41.010
...and fought until
you reached the top.

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:48.980
But when you saw the destruction...

00:18:48.980 --> 00:18:53.940
...you were devastated by the fact
that you had contributed to it.

00:18:53.940 --> 00:18:57.530
And the resentment you felt
likely set all this in motion.

00:18:58.280 --> 00:19:00.530
What good is the Shuffle Alliance?!

00:19:00.530 --> 00:19:03.700
I'm ashamed to be
the King of Hearts!

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:07.250
I'm sorry.

00:19:07.250 --> 00:19:10.580
It seems we placed a
heavy burden upon you.

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:14.290
Perhaps your mistake was about
how humanity should atone.

00:19:14.540 --> 00:19:18.050
Yet we can't claim that we
were in the right, either.

00:19:18.300 --> 00:19:22.300
In this era when everyone is
bound to take a mistaken path...

00:19:22.300 --> 00:19:26.140
...we must put our faith in
the new Shuffle Alliance.

00:19:26.140 --> 00:19:31.100
I think that's really the
only thing that we can do.

00:19:49.950 --> 00:19:51.570
Hey, Domon.

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:55.170
You taught me an important lesson.

00:19:55.170 --> 00:19:57.590
We are also a part of nature.

00:19:57.590 --> 00:20:01.670
And to eliminate humanity is
the same as destroying nature.

00:20:02.130 --> 00:20:06.350
I realize that I was about to
make the same mistake again.

00:20:07.390 --> 00:20:09.560
M-Master...

00:20:10.520 --> 00:20:13.770
You still call me "Master"?

00:20:13.770 --> 00:20:18.110
Only now do I truly
understand your deep sorrow.

00:20:18.110 --> 00:20:21.650
But all I could think about
was how to fight you.

00:20:21.650 --> 00:20:23.860
I never bothered to hear your side!

00:20:24.320 --> 00:20:26.320
Yet, right until the end...

00:20:26.700 --> 00:20:28.410
...you watched out for me.

00:20:28.410 --> 00:20:29.740
That's ridiculous.

00:20:29.740 --> 00:20:32.620
After all, I'm
nothing but a sinner.

00:20:32.620 --> 00:20:33.950
Nevertheless...

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:36.130
Take a look.

00:20:36.750 --> 00:20:39.590
Despite the terrible
things I've done...

00:20:39.590 --> 00:20:42.840
...there has never been one
Devil Gundam cell on my body.

00:20:43.420 --> 00:20:44.880
I knew that!

00:20:44.880 --> 00:20:47.050
I knew that all along, yet...!

00:20:47.050 --> 00:20:49.060
My dear Domon...

00:20:49.310 --> 00:20:52.730
If only I hadn't
met you in Shinjuku.

00:20:52.730 --> 00:20:55.740
If only you hadn't been forced
to become a Gundam Fighter.

00:20:56.860 --> 00:20:59.070
None of this would've
ever happened.

00:21:12.200 --> 00:21:13.750
How beautiful.

00:21:14.580 --> 00:21:16.460
Yes.

00:21:16.460 --> 00:21:18.840
I think it's very beautiful.

00:21:18.840 --> 00:21:20.470
Then let us say it.

00:21:20.750 --> 00:21:23.720
The school of the
Undefeated of the East!

00:21:23.720 --> 00:21:25.930
The winds of the king!

00:21:25.930 --> 00:21:27.390
Z enshin!

00:21:27.390 --> 00:21:29.100
Keiretsu!

00:21:29.430 --> 00:21:31.600
Tempa Kyoran!

00:21:31.930 --> 00:21:33.230
Look!

00:21:33.640 --> 00:21:38.310
The East is burning red!

00:21:42.940 --> 00:21:44.240
Master?

00:21:48.780 --> 00:21:49.960
Master...

00:21:51.920 --> 00:21:58.370
Master!

00:22:24.530 --> 00:22:28.320
<i>Donna yume o miteru no</i>
What are you dreaming of?

00:22:28.320 --> 00:22:30.820
<i>Odayaka na negao</i>
Your peaceful sleeping face

00:22:32.330 --> 00:22:36.120
<i>itoshikute kimi no kata</i>
Your gentle, warm shoulders

00:22:36.120 --> 00:22:38.670
<i>sotto dakiyoseta</i>
I draw them closer to me

00:22:39.620 --> 00:22:43.800
<i>hiroi kono tokai de</i>
In this great city

00:22:43.800 --> 00:22:47.470
<i>kimi to mukaeru asa ga</i>
The morning I greet with you

00:22:47.470 --> 00:22:54.180
<i>ichiban taisetsu dakara</i>
Is the most important thing to me

00:22:54.430 --> 00:23:01.730
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa ubaikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot find love

00:23:02.020 --> 00:23:06.280
<i>sou dareka kizutsuketemo</i>
Even if you were to hurt someone

00:23:06.480 --> 00:23:09.860
<i>kimi no egao dake wa yuzurenai</i>
I will never give up your smiling face

00:23:09.900 --> 00:23:17.330
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa mamorikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot protect love

00:23:17.330 --> 00:23:26.170
<i>kimidake o itsumo mitsumeteru</i>
I am always gazing only at you

00:23:33.140 --> 00:23:35.100
Everyone, it's the moment
you've been waiting for!

00:23:35.100 --> 00:23:38.490
Although Domon's win ended
the Gundam Fight Tournament...

00:23:38.510 --> 00:23:41.980
...it was also the start
of yet another battle!

00:23:41.980 --> 00:23:44.190
Ulube is plotting evil...

00:23:44.190 --> 00:23:46.240
...and Rain is about to be sacrificed.

00:23:46.240 --> 00:23:50.740
The bell rings to start the Fight
involving the whole universe!

00:23:50.740 --> 00:23:53.080
Next, on Mobile
Fighter G Gundam...

00:23:53.070 --> 00:23:56.620
Rain's crisis!
Return of the Devil Gundam.

00:23:54.370 --> 00:24:00.830
Rain's Crisis!
Return of the Devil Gundam

00:23:56.620 --> 00:23:58.950
Ready! Go!
